  "description": "The G4.WebDriver.Simulator package is a versatile WebDriver simulator designed for generic use, providing a browser-less automation environment. Tailored for scenarios beyond any specific framework, this simulator returns mocks and stubs, enabling efficient unit testing without launching a real browser. Seamlessly integrate this simulator into your projects, whether G4-based or not, to simulate WebDriver behavior, test automation flows, and perform unit testing with ease. Enhance your development and testing processes by leveraging this lightweight and flexible simulator.",
